# Output vault (generated, large, contains personal data)
obsidian_export/

# Sync state (personal OneNote metadata)
.sync_state.json
**/.sync_state.json

# Credentials (per-repo, machine-specific)
.anthropic-credentials.toml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
CLAUDE.md

# Vision AI generated outputs (written into the vault)
_ai_notes/
.vision_ai_cache.json
**/.vision_ai_cache.json

# Temp files from exploration
*.xml

# Entity ontology source files (large, re-downloadable)
entity_data/hgnc_complete_set.tsv
entity_data/mondo.json
entity_data/hgnc_genes.json
entity_data/mondo_diseases.json

# Entity data YAMLs: hand-curated and CONFIDENTIAL. Excluded deliberately and
# permanently, not as a convenience. They hold internal compound codes, internal
# department and site names, and curated commercial intelligence on companies and
# drugs, none of which may reach a public remote. Do not add them, and do not
# "fix" this rule by tracking them.
#
# NOT RECOVERABLE BY REBUILD. An earlier version of this comment said to rebuild
# with `setup.py --update-entities`; that flag only re-downloads the public
# ontology sources above (hgnc_complete_set.tsv, mondo.json) and never writes
# these files. There is no code path that regenerates hand-curated variants, so
# `git clone` plus setup leaves you with the dictionaries absent, and losing them
# loses the curation outright.
#
# Because git is not the backup here, these need one out of band. Measured at the
# time of writing: companies.yaml 787 lines, drugs.yaml 1356, methods.yaml 223,
# cell_lines.yaml 189, tag_vocabulary.yaml 138, pathways.yaml 131,
# clinical_trials.yaml 110, conferences.yaml 105, dictionary_pending.yaml 78,
# departments.yaml 56, internal_compounds.yaml 23.
#
# dictionary_denylist.yaml is the one exception and IS tracked: it carries no
# confidential data, only a list of terms that must never become entries, and it
# is the guard that stops auto-extension from reintroducing curated removals.
entity_data/*.yaml
!entity_data/dictionary_denylist.yaml

# Claude Code tooling
.claude/
